# Figures

Graphics and visualizations for reports and presentations.

Store generated plots, charts, and diagrams here.

## Usage

```python
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt

# Create visualization
plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))
plt.plot(data)
plt.title("Analysis Results")

# Save figure
plt.savefig('reports/figures/results_plot.png', dpi=300, bbox_inches='tight')
```

> [!TIP]
> Use high DPI (300) for publication-quality figures.
